The following MBSA files derive from the Maxwell-V1-Flash vLLM development
fork at commit 950d80710610ebffc41128dad89845346262af48:

  python/mbsa/index_formats.py
    From vllm/model_executor/layers/maxwell_moe_index_mxfp6.py.
  python/mbsa/mxfp6/write.py
    From vllm/model_executor/layers/maxwell_moe_mxfp6_write.py.
  python/mbsa/mxfp6/scoring.py
    Consolidates maxwell_moe_mxfp6_kernel.py and
    maxwell_moe_mxfp6_dg_kernel.py.
  python/mbsa/mxfp6/csrc/fp6_index_kernel.cuh
    From maxwell_moe_mxfp6_csrc/fp6_index_kernel.cuh.
  python/mbsa/mxfp6/csrc/fp6_ext.cu
    From maxwell_moe_mxfp6_csrc/fp6_ext.cu.

The fixed source snapshot was in a private development fork at extraction
time. PROVENANCE.md and UPSTREAM.json retain the source commit, paths, Git
blobs, source hashes, relationships, and current local hashes. Copyright
